<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">
<span class="c4">Weapons for Subtlety Rogue DPS</span></h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="main-hand-weapons-for-subtlety-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Main Hand Weapons for Subtlety Rogue DPS</span></h4>It is time my yellow friends, we get the very first class specific legendaries in <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77949/golad-twilight-of-aspects">
<img alt="Golad, Twilight of Aspects" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_deathwingraid_e_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Golad, Twilight of Aspects</span></a> and <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77950/tiriosh-nightmare-of-ages">
<img alt="Tiriosh, Nightmare of Ages" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_deathwingraid_e_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tiriosh, Nightmare of Ages</span></a>! These beautiful babies offer a wholly unique questline that requires us to do some stealthing around and assassination missions. It should take roughly 3 weeks to obtain them assuming a full clear so we'll have them in our hands shortly after the raid launches. In the meantime, Heroic or Normal <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78474/blade-of-the-unmaker">
