<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="off-hand-weapons-for-subtlety-rogue-dps">
<span class="c4">Off Hand Weapons for Subtlety Rogue DPS</span></h4>Of course you'll be trying to get <a class="q5 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77950/tiriosh-nightmare-of-ages">
<img alt="Tiriosh, Nightmare of Ages" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_deathwingraid_e_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Tiriosh, Nightmare of Ages</span></a> as soon as possible. In the meantime, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77948/the-dreamer">
<img alt="The Dreamer" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_deathwingraid_e_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">The Dreamer</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78414/electrowing-dagger">
<img alt="Electrowing Dagger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_knife_1h_deathwingraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Electrowing Dagger</span></a> are very identical in output so you'll be happy if <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=55689/hagara-the-stormbinder">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Hagara the Stormbinder</span></a> drops her dagger on your first clear. Based on the current sim strength of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78472/nokaled-the-elements-of-death">
<img alt="No'Kaled, the Elements of Death" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_axe_1h_deathwingraiddw_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">No'Kaled, the Elements of Death</span></a> it is a viable Off-Hand option for the same reason as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68161/krol-decapitator">
<img alt="Krol Decapitator" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_18.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Krol Decapitator</span></a> in Pre-BiS for T11. Sub just really like having high weapon damage.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Enchants</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52760/enchant-weapon-hurricane">
<img alt="Enchant Weapon - Hurricane" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Weapon - Hurricane</span></a>. Your off-hand poison will be <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=2892/deadly-poison">
